      },
      "quote": "… arnings and Precautions (5.2) ] . patients with preexisting gallbladder disease [see Warnings and Precautions (5.5) ] . nursing mothers [see Use in Specific Populations (8.2) ] . patients with known hypersensitivity to fenofibrate or fenofibric acid [see Warnings and Precautions (5.9) ] .",
